{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42412","headline":"寄麻姑仙坛道士 · 查文徽","name":"寄麻姑仙坛道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别後相思鹤信稀，郡楼南望远峰迷。\n人归仙洞云连地，花落春林水满溪。\n白发只应悲镜镊，丹砂犹待寄刀圭。\n方平车驾今何在，常苦尘中日易西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"查文徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}